---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import PostRow from '../components/PostRow.astro';
import {posts,bondPosts,bondUrl,dateLabel} from '../lib/content.mjs';
const featured = posts[0];
---
<Shell>
  <section class="home-hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-main"><div class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> CHANGJIN HAN / BLOG</div><h1>읽은 논문과<br/><span class="serif accent">만든 것들.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">음성 AI를 연구해 왔습니다.<br/>논문을 읽고 정리한 글, 발표 자료, 새로 만든 페이지를 올립니다.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">소개 보기 <span>↗</span></a></div>
    <aside class="hero-aside"><div class="profile-stamp"><img src="/assets/images/profile.jpg" alt="Changjin Han" width="88" height="88"/><span>SPEECH AI<br/>RESEARCHER</span></div><div class="hero-note"><span class="small-label">남겨둔 말</span><p>그냥 하는 사람이<br/>가장 압도적이다.</p><span class="handwriting">Changjin Han</span></div><div class="hero-count"><span>{posts.length} notes</span><span>Since 2020 ↗</span></div></aside>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap home-columns"><div class="main-column"><div class="section-heading"><h2>최근 글<span class="section-index">01 / BLOG</span></h2><a href="/blog/">글 전체 보기 ↗</a></div>
  <a class="featured-post" href={featured.url}><div class="feature-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="orbit orbit-three"></div><span class="art-coordinate">BLOG / {featured.date.slice(0,4)}</span><span class="art-word">{posts.length}<br/><em>notes.</em></span><span class="art-plus">+</span></div><div class="featured-copy"><div class="eyebrow">LATEST POST <span>· {dateLabel(featured.date)}</span></div><h2>{featured.displayTitle}</h2><p>{featured.description}</p><span class="text-link">읽어보기 ↗</span></div></a>
  <div>{posts.slice(1,5).map(post=><PostRow post={post}/>)}</div></div>
  <aside class="home-sidebar"><div class="section-heading"><h2>주제별 글<span class="section-index">02 / TOPICS</span></h2></div><a class="topic-link" href="/blog/?topic=Speech%20%26%20Audio"><span>01</span> Speech & Audio <b>↗</b></a><a class="topic-link" href="/blog/?topic=AI%20%26%20Agents"><span>02</span> AI & Agents <b>↗</b></a><a class="topic-link" href="/blog/?topic=Time%20Series"><span>03</span> Time Series <b>↗</b></a>
  <a class="bond-promo" href="/bondnote/"><span class="eyebrow">BONDNOTE</span><h3>bond<span class="serif">note.</span></h3><p>채권시장과 AI에 관한 논문, 기관 자료, 퀀트사 글을 날짜별로 모았습니다.</p><div class="mini-bars" aria-hidden="true">{[25,42,32,57,44,70,61,86,74].map(h=><span style={`height:${h}%`}></span>)}</div><span class="text-link">Bondnote 보기 ↗</span></a>
  <div class="sidebar-note"><span class="eyebrow">PAPERS & TALKS</span><p>발표한 논문과<br/>세미나 자료.</p><a class="text-link" href="/publications/">논문·발표 보기 ↗</a></div></aside></section>
  <section class="wrap bond-home"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Bondnote 최근 글<span class="section-index">03 / BONDNOTE</span></h2><a href="/bondnote/">아카이브 보기 ↗</a></div><div class="note-grid">{bondPosts.slice(0,3).map((p,i)=><a class="note-card" href={bondUrl(p)}><div class="note-card-meta"><time>{dateLabel(p.date)}</time><span>↗</span></div><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.intro}</p><span class="small-label">{p.articles.length} RESEARCH NOTES · {p.readMinutes} MIN</span></a>)}</div></section>
</Shell>
